          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ആൽമരം (ālmaraṁ) is native Dravidian: āl, \"banyan\" (DEDR 382, with Tamil āl and Kannada āl), and maram, \"tree\" (DEDR 4711)."
